&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cross-asset architecture supporting equities, derivatives and evolving Digital Assets features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Close interaction between Product, Engineering and infrastructure teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
